====Suffix====
{{ang-head|verbf|inflsuf=1}}

# {{ng|marks the second person singular present indicative of class II weak verbs}}
#: {{afex|ang|lufian<t:to love>|lufast<t:you/thou love>}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desctree|enm|-est|id=second-person singular}}

===Etymology 2===

====Suffix====
{{h|ang|suf}}

# {{alt form|ang|-ost}}

