==Old English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ang|-cynd|-cundes}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ang|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*kundaz|t=born, natured}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*ǵn̥h₁tós}}. Cognate with {{cog|non|-kundr}}, {{cog|got|-𐌺𐌿𐌽𐌳𐍃}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ang-IPA|cund}}

===Suffix===
{{ang-adj}}

# {{ng|forms adjectives denoting origin, derivation, or likeness}}
#: {{afex|ang|æþele<t:noble>|æþelcund<t:of noble birth>}}
