====Suffix====
{{ang-noun||f}}

# {{senseid|ang|female}} {{ng|forms female equivalent nouns; often with {{lg|i-mutation}}}}
#: {{afex|ang|god<t:(male) god>|gyden<t:goddess>|qq=with i-mutation}}
