{{ety|ang|:inh|gmw-pro:*-īn<id:adjective>|id=adjectival}}
{{inh+|ang|gmw-pro|*-īn}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-īnaz}}.

====Suffix====
{{ang-adj}}

# {{ng|forms adjectives meaning “material made of, consisting of”, also sometimes “characteristic of”; with {{lg|i-mutation}}}}
#: {{afex|ang|gold<t:gold>|gylden<t:golden>}}
#: {{afex|ang|ātor<t:poison>|ǣtren<t:venomous, poisonous>}}
#: {{afex|ang|stān<t:stone>|stǣnen<t:stonen>}}
#: {{afex|ang|āc<t:oak>|ǣcen<t:oaken>}}
#: {{afex|ang|trēow<t:tree>|triewen<t:wooden>}}
#: {{afex|ang|līn<t:flax>|līnen<t:linen>}}
#: {{afex|ang|sǣ<t:sea>|sǣn<t:marine>}}
#: {{afex|ang|fæder<t:father>|fæderen<t:paternal>}}

