{{ang-adj}}

# {{ng|forms adjectives meaning “characteristic of”; without {{lg|i-mutation}}}}
#: {{afex|ang|tungol<t:star>|tunglen<t:of the stars, sidereal, starry>}}
#: {{afex|ang|hund<t:dog, hound>|hunden<t:canine>}}

===Etymology 5===
{{inh+|ang|gmw-pro|*-an}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-anaz}}.

====Suffix====
{{ang-head|part|inflsuf=1}}

# {{ng|forms the past participle of strong verbs}}
#: {{uxi|ang|[[ġecumen]]|t=come}}
#: {{uxi|ang|[[ġecorfen]]|t=carved}}
#: {{uxi|ang|[[ġeswōgen]]|t=swooned}}

===Etymology 6===
{{inh+|ang|gem-pro|*-īni}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-īniz}}. Sometimes with geminate -nn-, probably due to confusion with the feminine suffix from {{m|gem-pro|*-inī}}.

====Suffix====
{{ang-noun||f}}

# {{ng|forms nouns from class 1 weak verbs, with {{lg|i-mutation}}}
#: {{afex|ang|byrġan<t:to bury>|byrġen<t:burying, grave>}}
